{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo version of Market Empire Simulator. It has the beginning version of the game but it won't get the new updates and features, you can still create your own small market empire!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run Your Own Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a modest store and turn it into the go-to shopping destination. Control everything from inventory to pricing, ensuring customers leave satisfied and keep coming back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stock Your Shelves Wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right products and arrange them strategically to attract customers. From everyday essentials to specialty items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand and Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your store with better equipment, more shelves, and a bigger layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Join our community on Discord!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc49 </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770970?t=1748608459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770970?t=1748608459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770970/2d665b40c0a9058fedc1fc484e65e27e1538befc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748608459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770970/2d665b40c0a9058fedc1fc484e65e27e1538befc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748608459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo version of Market Empire Simulator. It has the beginning version of the game but it won't get the new updates and features, you can still create your own small market empire!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong